  <NAME>Mus musculus</NAME>
  <TITLE>PCGF6-PRC1 suppresses premature differentiation of embryonic stem cells by silencing germ cell-related genes [RNA-Seq]</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>Expression data of ES cells with or without Pcgf6, Ring1A/B, Max and Mga. Expression data of ES cells with or without Cbx1/3. Overall design: Mouse embryonic stem cells deficient for Pcgf6 and associating genes were evaluated using RNA-seq. Mouse embryonic stem cells deficient for Cbx1/3 and associating genes were evaluated using RNA-seq.</DESCRIPTION>
